tion components function correctly together and meet the specified requirements.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"A 'Test Integration' activity must be followed by a 'Deploy Integration' activity at some point later in the same process instance. Conversely, a 'Deploy Integration' event can occur only if a 'Test Integration' event has occurred before it within the same process instance. This bidirectional and ordered dependency ensures that 'Test Integration' imposes obligations for future 'Deploy Integration', and 'Deploy Integration' cannot occur without prior 'Test Integration'. Multiple 'Test Integration' and 'Deploy Integration' are allowed, with each 'Test Integration' eventually leading to a 'Deploy Integration' and each 'Deploy Integration' being justified by a preceding 'Test Integration'.\",\"template\":\"Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Test Integration\",\"description\":\"The 'Test Integration' activity includes executing tests to verify that the integration components function correctly together and meet the specified requirements.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Deploy Integration\",\"description\":\"The 'Deploy Integration' activity represents the process of moving the tested integration solution into the production environment for live operation.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"Whenever a 'Deploy Integration' activity occurs, it must be immediately followed by a 'Monitor System Performance' activity in the next event position, with no other events in between. The 'Monitor System Performance' activity is allowed to happen isolated.\",\"template\":\"Chain Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Deploy Integration\",\"description\":\"The 'Deploy Integration' activity represents the process of moving the tested integration solu