n Design' in any order, provided they are not adjacent in the event sequence.\",\"template\":\"Not Chain Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Review Integration Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Review Integration Plan' activity involves evaluating and assessing the integration plan to ensure its feasibility, completeness, and alignment with business objectives.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Approve Integration Design\",\"description\":\"The 'Approve Integration Design' activity represents the formal authorization and sign-off on the proposed system architecture and integration design.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"A 'Validate Integration Results' activity cannot be preceded by an 'Approve Integration Design' activity within the same process instance. If an 'Approve Integration Design' event has occurred at any point before a 'Validate Integration Results' event, then 'Validate Integration Results' is disallowed. Multiple instances of 'Validate Integration Results' and 'Approve Integration Design' can occur, but all instances of 'Validate Integration Results' must occur before any instance of 'Approve Integration Design'.\",\"template\":\"Not Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Validate Integration Results\",\"description\":\"The 'Validate Integration Results' activity includes verifying and confirming that the integration outcomes meet the expected criteria and business requirements.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Approve Integration Design\",\"description\":\"The 'Approve Integration Design' activity represents the formal authorization and sign-off on the proposed system architecture and integration design.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"An 'Update System Documentation' activity must not be followed by a 'Gather User Feedback' activity a